e␀sleep_forever␀cs_enable_pathfinding_failsafe␀cs_go_to␀boss/mid_land␀cs_face_player␀cs_enable_targeting␀custom_animation␀ai_get_unit␀ai_current_actor␀objects\characters\brute\brute␀combat:rifle:cheer␀combat:rifle:taunt␀combat:rifle:shakefist␀boss/ledge_perch␀cs_crouch␀cs_face_object␀ai_get_object␀boss_tartarus␀cs_aim_object␀cs_shoot␀counter_boss_tartarus_taunt␀what? is the mighty arbiter afraid?!␀sound_impulse_start␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_0980_tar␀you want revenge?! well here i am! come and take it!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_0990_tar␀just like the rest of your kind - you are cowardly and weak!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1000_tar␀set␀counter_boss_johnson_prompt␀skip_boss_johnson_prompt␀hey, mohawk! how'd that feel?!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2010_jon␀boss_johnson␀his shield is down! let him have it!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2020_jon␀there goes his shield!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2030_jon␀got his shield! hit him now!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2040_jon␀quick! while his shield is down!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2050_jon␀i can keep his shield down, but you're gonna have to finish the job!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_2060_jon␀>␀seconds␀sound_looping_start␀sound\ambience\deltacontolroom\boss\stage1␀charging sequence initiated! primary generators coming on-line!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1040_gsp␀boss_monitor␀sound_impulse_language_time␀well, shut them down!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1050_mir␀boss_miranda␀apology. protocol does allow me to interfere with any aspect of the sequence.␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1060_gsp␀then how do i stop it?!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1120_mir␀well…it will take some time to go over the proper procedures…␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1130_gsp␀quit stalling!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1140_mir␀under more controlled circumstances, i would suggest the reclaimer simply remove the index.␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1150_gsp␀that's it?! johnson, i'm on it!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1160_mir␀hang-tight, ma'am! not until that brute is dead!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1170_jon␀boss_flavor_done␀sound\ambience\deltacontolroom\boss\stage2␀secondary generators charging! all systems are performing well within operational parameters!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1070_gsp␀sound\ambience\deltacontolroom\boss\stage3␀power-generation phase complete! the installation is ready to fire! starting final countdown…␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1180_gsp␀c'mon, arbiter! kick that guy's ass!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1190_jon␀and may i say, reclaimers, it has been a pleasure to serve you both! goodbye!␀sound\dialog\levels\08_controlroom\mission\l08_1200_gsp␀scenarios\solo\08b_deltacontrol\08b_music\08b_11␀volume_test_objects␀tv_boss_platform␀scenarios\solo\08b_deltacontrol\08b_music\08b_12␀mark_boss_first_cycle␀scenarios\solo\08b_deltacontrol\08b_music\08b_13␀difficulty_legendary␀random_range␀difficulty_heroic␀object_set_function_variable␀invincibility␀/␀boss_tartarus_invincible␀ai_berserk␀boss_tartarus_berserk␀berserk␀switch_bsp␀ai_allegiance␀player␀human␀covenant␀sentinel␀prophet␀object_teleport␀boss_player0_flag␀boss_player1_flag␀kill_volume_enable␀kill_e13_0␀device_set_position_immediate␀e13_rotors␀device_operates_automatically_set␀e12_door1␀count_boss_cycle␀ai_place␀unit_impervious␀ai_cannot_die␀unit_only_takes_damage_from_players_team␀object_set_scale␀boss_tartarus_invincible_on␀cs_run_command_script␀cs_boss_tartarus_stunned␀ai_actors␀object_cannot_die␀cs_boss_miranda_nocrouch␀ai_disregard␀cinematic_lighting_set_primary_light␀cinematic_lighting_set_secondary_light␀cinematic_lighting_set_ambient_light␀ob